<body><div id="game"></div><div class="shade"></div>
<div id="menu"><div class="menu-content"><div class="eyebrow">A story from the Eastern Front · 1942</div><h1 class="title">Frontlines<span>of Freedom</span></h1><p class="intro">Stalingrad, September 1942. The city is breaking apart around you. Find your squad, guide a family through the ruins, and hold the crossing long enough for them to reach safety.</p><div class="chapter"><strong>01 — The City That Would Not Fall</strong><small>Stalingrad · Volga River · September 1942</small></div><div class="actions"><button class="primary" id="start">Enter the battle <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button><button class="secondary" id="controls">Controls & settings</button></div><div class="footnote">A fictional squad's story set against real events. Historical suffering is portrayed with respect.</div></div></div>
<div id="hud"><div class="topline"><div class="mission"><div class="label">Mission 01 · Stalingrad</div><strong>THE CITY THAT WOULD NOT FALL</strong></div><div class="counter" id="objectiveCount">OBJECTIVE 01 / 03</div></div><div class="objective"><div class="label">Current orders</div><div id="objectiveText">Rendezvous with Sergeant Orlov near the shattered tram.</div></div><div class="crosshair"></div><div class="reticlehit" id="hitmarker"></div><div class="toast" id="toast"></div><div class="interact" id="interact">[ E ]  HELP THE CIVILIANS</div><div class="bottomleft"><div class="healthrow"><span>VITALS</span><span id="healthNum">100</span></div><div class="healthtrack"><div class="healthfill" id="healthFill"></div></div></div><div class="ammo"><b id="ammoNum">05</b> &nbsp; / &nbsp; 30 &nbsp; <span style="color:#aaa">MOSIN-NAGANT</span></div><div class="hint">W A S D &nbsp; MOVE<br>MOUSE &nbsp; LOOK &nbsp; · &nbsp; CLICK &nbsp; FIRE<br>E &nbsp; INTERACT &nbsp; · &nbsp; R &nbsp; RELOAD</div></div>
<div id="briefing"><div class="briefcard"><div class="eyebrow">Field report · 13 September 1942</div><h2 id="briefTitle">Orders from Orlov</h2><p id="briefText">The Germans have cut through the district. Orlov's squad is holding the tram junction while a family shelters in the basement nearby. Get them to the cellar passage. No one gets left behind.</p><button class="primary" id="briefContinue">Understood →</button></div></div>
<div id="options" class="briefing" style="display:none"><div class="briefcard"><div class="eyebrow">Display & controls</div><h2>Field settings</h2><p>Choose a visual preset for your device. You can change this before each sortie.</p><label for="quality" style="display:block;font:600 12px 'Barlow Condensed';letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:16px 0 7px">Graphics quality</label><select id="quality" style="width:100%;padding:12px;background:#292d28;color:#eee9dd;border:1px solid #68695e"><option value="low">Low · mobile performance</option><option value="balanced" selected>Balanced · recommended</option><option value="high">High · shadows & detail</option></select><div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:18px"><button class="primary" id="applySettings">Apply</button><button class="secondary" id="closeSettings">Back</button></div><p style="font-size:10px">WASD / left stick: move · Mouse / drag: look · Click / FIRE: shoot · E / USE: interact · R: reload</p></div></div>
